WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.393
Magppie is not, in the end, a kitchen company.

1.2
00:00:07.393 --> 00:00:14.787
It is a wellness company that happens to build kitchens.

1.3
00:00:14.787 --> 00:00:22.180
It began with years spent studying how India actually cooks — the climate, the culture, the daily use — and then building for that, rather than importing a kitchen designed for somewhere else.

2.1
00:00:22.180 --> 00:00:27.426
Our mission is to transform ordinary homes into wellness homes.

2.2
00:00:27.426 --> 00:00:32.672
Spaces that keep you, your family, and the planet safe.

3.1
00:00:32.672 --> 00:00:39.591
Magppie launched in two thousand, bringing steel, and later stone-based design, to Indian homes.

3.2
00:00:39.591 --> 00:00:46.510
By two thousand and seven it had gone global, across more than thirty-five countries.

3.3
00:00:46.510 --> 00:00:53.429
In twenty twenty-three came the Wellness Kitchen — the world’s first hundred per cent stone modular kitchen.

3.4
00:00:53.429 --> 00:01:00.348
And in February twenty twenty-six, recognition at the K B I S Innovation Hour in Orlando.

4.1
00:01:00.348 --> 00:01:07.903
The difference is the material.

4.2
00:01:07.903 --> 00:01:15.458
A Magppie kitchen is built from engineered stone rather than wood, inside and out.

4.3
00:01:15.458 --> 00:01:23.013
There is nothing for termites to eat, nothing that swells when it gets wet, and no formaldehyde released into the room where you cook.

4.4
00:01:23.013 --> 00:01:30.568
The stone is infused with silver and copper at nano scale, which is what makes the surface itself resist bacteria — not a coating that wears off, but a property of the material.

5.1
00:01:30.568 --> 00:01:37.772
It is built by a team working across India, the United States, Europe and Denmark.

6.1
00:01:37.772 --> 00:01:42.290
The objective is simple to say, and hard to do.

6.2
00:01:42.290 --> 00:01:46.807
Make an ordinary home a place that actively looks after the people living in it.

6.3
00:01:46.807 --> 00:01:51.325
The kitchens are beautiful, and that matters — but the beauty is the bonus.

6.4
00:01:51.325 --> 00:01:55.842
Health is the point.

6.5
00:01:55.842 --> 00:02:00.360
Rooted in how India has always cooked, built for how it will.

